      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "當自己陷入中毒、麻痺、灼傷等\n狀態時，向對手使用此招式，\n威力會變成２倍。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une attaque dont la puissance double lorsque\nle lanceur est empoisonné, paralysé ou brûlé.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ist der Anwender vergiftet, paralysiert oder leidet er\nunter Verbrennungen, verdoppelt sich die Kraft der\nAttacke.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ataca con el doble de potencia si el usuario está\nquemado, paralizado o envenenado.",
