        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "In this two-turn attack, the user gathers light and fills a\nblade with the light’s energy, attacking the target on the\nnext turn.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "１ターン目に　光を　いっぱいに　集め\n２ターン目に　その　力を\n剣に　込めて　攻撃する。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "第１回合收集满满的日光，\n第２回合将此力量\n集中在剑上进行攻击。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "El usuario dedica un turno a absorber energía lumínica\ny concentrarla en forma de cuchilla con la que ataca al\nrival en el siguiente turno.",
